# Vercel CLI project link + the OIDC token it writes into .env.local.
.vercel
.env.local

# NOTE: deliberately NOT the `.env*` the Vercel CLI writes here by default.
# This project commits .env.development, .env.production and .env.example on
# purpose - none holds a secret, and .env.production is what points a build at
# the deployed API. A blanket .env* silently excludes all three.
